      text ask "What does this mean in English?" width=32
      choice pick options=[pick(k, "I prefer the bus because it is quick.", "The boat leaves at ten.", "I go to school on foot.", "I prefer the bus because it is quick.", "I prefer the bus because it is quick.", "The boat leaves at ten."), pick(k, "How do you go to school?", "I go to school on foot.", "We go to the beach by bike.", "The boat leaves at ten.", "My father goes to work by train.", "I prefer the bus because it is quick."), pick(k, "My father goes to work by train.", "We go to the beach by bike.", "The boat leaves at ten.", "I go to school on foot.", "We go to the beach by bike.", "My father goes to work by train."), pick(k, "We go to the beach by bike.", "My father goes to work by train.", "My father goes to work by train.", "My father goes to work by train.", "The boat leaves at ten.", "We go to the beach by bike.")] stack=column
